      "name": "Fidget Benchy (3D Benchy remix)",
      "slug": "fidget-benchy-3d-benchy-remix",
      "summary": "Wobble the funnel, click the lever and rotate the joystick! 3 fidget toys in the most famous model ever!",
      "description": "<p><strong>! IMPORTANT INFORMATION !</strong></p><p><i><strong>This version of the model is outdated</strong></i> and has been since improved to ensure higher probability of succesful prints, still with same assets.<i><strong> I would recommend you printing the new version</strong></i>, because many people had problems with the old one.</p><p><strong>Download it here: </strong><a href=\"https://www.printables.com/model/1294643-fidget-benchy-20\"><strong>https://www.printables.com/model/1294643-fidget-benchy-20</strong></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Print the Benchy and than have fun with 3 inbuilt fidget assets.</p><p>But it is still a torture test, now maybe even harder, so I don't recommend it to beginners.</p><p><strong>Print settings:</strong></p><ul><li>0,15 mm layer height</li><li>15% infill</li><li>no supports</li></ul><p><strong>Post printing:</strong></p><ol><li>Cut the brim of the benchy.</li><li>Apply some force to free the joystick. Be careful not to break anything else.</li><li>Carefully free the spring and the lever. Some force mightt be needed but be more careful about it than with the joystick.</li><li><strong>Have fun with the Benchy!</strong> (But don't forget that the funnel might be a bit brittle.)</li></ol>",
